- No use of TLS, IPsec config, or authentication parameters (Not in scope)
- SCTP streams = 2 in/out (minimum recommended is 10 per 3GPP TS 38.413 for reliability and performance)
- local_s_portc = 501 and remote_s_portc = 500 (SCTP ports)
- SCTP ports are non-privileged (>1024) for local_s_portc = 501 (below 1024—privileged)
